{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swipepi is a relaxing, mind-bending, minimalist puzzle game that offers over 500 hand-crafted levels to immerse yourself into. A beautifully meditative soundtrack accompanies you in your delightful experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How to play</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is simple: use the arrow keys to move Swipepi while you are filling the board (or swipe to move Swipepi on devices like the Steam Deck). You will also find challenges such as teleporters and removable blocks that will put you thinking and make this game a real challenge for your brain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalistic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >500 hand-crafted puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing atmosphere</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3940900?t=1757097413","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3940900?t=1757097413","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940900/ad304cb099aba26cc367a7bb605d3437c8ba0a5f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757097413","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940900/ad304cb099aba26cc367a7bb605d3437c8ba0a5f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757097413","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swipepi is a relaxing, mind-bending, minimalist puzzle game that offers over 500 hand-cra